{"id":"gamefreak-director-194","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"[GameFreak部长专栏] 第194回","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一前往六本木新城工作，在强风与云层流动的东京，观察宝可梦公司的建筑与城市风景。","date":"2011-05-31","publication":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第194回","source":{"title":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第194回","url":"https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/05/index.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/05/index.html","type":"official_blog"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","宝可梦","官方博客"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","翻译资料"],"topics":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/entry-194/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194a.jpg","cover_kind":"own","size":[192,256],"archive_type":"gamefreak_director_column","summary":"增田顺一前往六本木新城工作，在强风与云层流动的东京，观察宝可梦公司的建筑与城市风景。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"说到这个蜘蛛造型的物件……会在哪里呢？？\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n5月30日，今天我在宝可梦公司所在的六本木新城工作。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n一边为入口的巨大和设计感动不已……\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n帅气的入口。人好小！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n从入口向右侧望去。这个设计也是，我一边想着“为什么要做成这样呢？？”……\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n在这座超级帅气的建筑物前……我一边想着，到底要怎样才能想出这样的设计呢……\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n宝可梦公司的入口。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n入口……\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n入口。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n从会议室向外望去……\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n这天的东京风特别大，云层正呼呼地飘过。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n在东京，几乎看不到山！！\n\n说到山，也就只有富士山了！！\n\n这就是东京的景色！\n\n如果要亲手打造一座最厉害的建筑物，会怎么做呢？？\n\n或者，\n\n生活在怎样的地区、怎样的景色之中才是最好的呢？\n\n还有，\n\n我觉得，对于创作者来说，思考这些事情是很有必要的。\n\n那么，回头见！\n\n\n\n\n<details class=\"gf-director-language\"><summary>查看官方英文版</summary>\n\nLocation of spider object, take a wild guess…?\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nOn May 30th, today I have a business meeting with\n\nthe Pokémon Company at Roppongi Hills(Tokyo) building.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nImpressed by its big entrance and design…\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nCool entrance. People are so small!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nView of the right side from entrance.\n\nI wonder why the design have done like this??\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nIn front of super cool building…\n\nI wonder how the design come up\n\nlike this?\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nEntrance of the Pokèmon Company.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nEntrance…\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nEntrance.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nView from the meeting room.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nThis day in Tokyo, wind is blowing\n\nstrong and cloud is floating away.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/en/194k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nNo mountain can be seen from Tokyo!!\n\nOnly mountain we can see is Mt. Fuji!!\n\nThat’s the view from Tokyo!\n\nIt is necessary to think as follows for creation.\n\nIf I make a structure, how to build the awesome building?\n\nWhere is the best location to live with the view?\n\nSee ya.\n\n\n</details>","markdown_ja":"このクモのオブジェクトと言えば？、、、どこでしょう？？\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n５月３０日、今日は株式会社ポケモンのある六本木ヒルズで仕事です。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n入り口の大きとそのデザインに感動しつつ。。。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nかっこいい入り口。ひとちっちゃ！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n入り口から右側を見たところ。このデザインも、どうしてこうしたのか？？などと考えつつ。。。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n超かっこいい建造物の前で。。。どうやったらこんなデザイン思いつくかなぁ。などと考えつつ。。。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n株式会社ポケモンの入り口。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n入り口。。。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n入り口。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n会議室から外を見たところ。。。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nこの日の東京は超風が強く、雲がガンガン流れてます。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/194/ja/194k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n東京って、ほとんど山が見えません！！\n\n山と言えば、富士山ぐらい！！\n\nそういう景色が東京です！\n\n最強の建築物を自分で作るとするならどうする？？\n\nとか、\n\nどんな地域、景色で生活するのが一番なのか？\n\nなど、\n\nそういったことを考えることが作り手には必要だと思ってます。\n\nでは。"}}